{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 30, "model_name": "mistralai/mixtral-8x7b-instruct-v0.1", "content": " Title: A captivating journey through Japan\n\nLast month, I had the opportunity to visit Japan, a country known for its rich history, unique culture, and technological advancements. The moment I stepped off the plane, I was greeted by the bustling streets of Tokyo, filled with neon lights and the sounds of vending machines dispensing all sorts of drinks and snacks.\n\n\nMy first stop was the historic Asakusa district, where I visited the Senso-ji temple, Tokyo's oldest temple. The temple's vibrant red color and intricate carvings were a sight to behold. I took a stroll down Nakamise-dori, a traditional shopping street lined with souvenir shops and street food stalls. I indulged in some delicious Tokyo-style sushi and savored the aroma of roasted senbei (rice crackers).\n\n\nThe next day, I visited the Meiji Shrine, a Shinto shrine dedicated to Emperor Meiji and Empress Shoken. The peaceful and serene atmosphere was a stark contrast to the lively streets of Tokyo. I took a moment to reflect and write my wishes on an ema, a wooden plaque, which I then hung on a designated rack.\n\n\nNo trip to Japan would be complete without experiencing its bullet train, the Shinkansen. I took a ride from Tokyo to Kyoto, Japan's former capital, and was amazed by the speed and efficiency of the train. The scenic views of Mt. Fuji and the Japanese countryside were an added bonus.\n\n\nKyoto was a city filled with temples, shrines, and traditional tea houses. I visited the Fushimi Inari Shrine, known for its thousands of vermilion torii gates that form a tunnel up the mountain. I also took a stroll through the Arashiyama Bamboo Grove, where I was surrounded by towering bamboo stalks that swayed gently in the wind.\n\n\nMy final stop was Osaka, a city known for its modern architecture and delicious street food. I indulged in some takoyaki (octopus balls) and okonomiyaki (savory pancake) before visiting the Osaka Castle. The castle's imposing structure and beautiful gardens were a sight to behold.\n\n\nJapan was a captivating journey, filled with new experiences, delicious food, and friendly people. I can't wait to plan my next trip to this beautiful country.", "logprobs": [{"token": "Title", "logprob": -0.007975990884006023}, {"token": ":", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -0.08805465698242188}, {"token": "capt", "logprob": -0.5870134830474854}, {"token": "iv", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "ating", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "journey", "logprob": -0.05494425445795059}, {"token": "through", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.5231307744979858}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.045371148735284805}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "Last", "logprob": -1.0843762159347534}, {"token": "month", "logprob": -0.06775996088981628}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "I", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "had", "logprob": -0.0006808108882978559}, {"token": "the", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "opportunity", "logprob": -0.16650274395942688}, {"token": "to", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "visit", "logprob": -0.13965700566768646}, {"token": "Japan", "logprob": -0.001328658196143806}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.026602881029248238}, {"token": "a", "logprob": -0.000490068516228348}, {"token": "country", "logprob": -0.475660115480423}, {"token": "known", "logprob": -0.8909383416175842}, {"token": "for", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "its", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": "rich", "logprob": -0.003658389439806342}, {"token": "history", "logprob": -0.051677849143743515}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -2.264974000354414e-06}, {"token": "unique", "logprob": -0.5989040732383728}, {"token": "culture", "logprob": -0.0012827033642679453}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.0003800861886702478}, {"token": "and", "logprob": -1.3708974620385561e-05}, {"token": "techno